Description: use CLAP plugins on a JACK rig, driven like mod-host
 omx-clap-host brings CLAP plugins, the modern open plugin format, into a
 live JACK or PipeWire rig. Each plugin runs as a JACK client with its own
 ports, and an instrument gets a MIDI input as well. Anything that already
 controls mod-host can control it over the same socket with the same
 commands. LV2 plugins run in it too, by their URI, through its LV2 to CLAP
 adapter, which loads lilv when the first one is added.
 .
 It comes with omx-clap-scan, which lists what is in a CLAP bundle and
 survives a plugin that crashes while loading.

